      <Desc>LAUNCHBIO'S MISSION AND IMPACT:LAUNCHBIO IDENTIFIES, COUNSELS, AND SUPPORTS HIGH-GROWTH, HIGH-IMPACT LIFE SCIENCE AND BIOTECHNOLOGY COMPANIES.ITS MISSION IS TO BUILD AN ECOSYSTEM OF INNOVATION FOR THE BENEFIT OF HUMAN HEALTH AND WELL-BEING.LAUNCHBIO'S IMPACT IS MEASURED BY ITS SUCCESS IN CONNECTING ENTREPRENEURS WITH KNOWLEDGE, CAPITAL AND TALENT - INCLUDING EACH OTHER - NOT ONLY WITHIN GEOGRAPHIC REGIONS, BUT ACROSS THE NATION'S LEADING LIFE SCIENCE HUBS.ENTREPRENEURS CAN SPEND THEIR TIME WORKING ON THEIR SCIENCE, WHILE LAUNCHBIO OFFERS EDUCATION ON BUILDING A BUSINESS, CONNECTING TO RESOURCES AND SUBJECT MATTER EXPERTS, AND INTRODUCTIONS TO FUNDING SOURCES. LAUNCHBIO PLACES ENTREPRENEURS AT THE HEART OF IT'S MISSION. STARTING A LIFE SCIENCE COMPANY IS CHALLENGING, AND IT CAN BE DIFFICULT TO GET THE HELP NEEDED TO ADVANCE AN IDEA, FIND PARTNERS AND FUNDING, AND NAVIGATE THE REGULATORY LANDSCAPE TO ACHIEVE SUCCESS.</Desc>
